<title>UK: London gold fixes slightly easier on U.S. PPI.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes slightly easier on U.S. PPI.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $319.50 vs $320.60 AM. Easier on U.S. PPI confirming inflation under control. Lifted overnight on short covering but bear trend intact.</p>
<p>SILVER - Steady at $4.38/$4.40, up five cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Up $8.00 at $404.00/$408.00 rebounding after weakening on Russian export news.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Similarly up $5.00 at $167.00/$171.00.</p>
</text>
